    let (key, value) = line.split_once('=')?;
    Some((key.trim().to_string(), value.trim().to_string()))
}
```

### 5. No tests (whole file)
**Rule:** logic has no tests; doc examples absent (skill documentation-and-tests rules).

**Problem:** one test with a blank line would have caught finding 2; any test at all would have caught finding 1, because nothing in this file compiles. For a module you plan to build on, the contract ("what is a valid line, what happens to duplicates") is untested.

**Fix:**
```rust
